# Fixed defect 2463, 2026-11-10, lane b30-pkg: a package named `main`.
# `heroes new main --package` wrote it and `heroes add --path` added it, and
# the line `heroes new` offered, `use <main>/main`, was refused
# `shadowed_binding` against the program's `function main()`. Now both verbs
# refuse the name before anything is written, in the words of the one rule
# every place naming an entry asks (`module/entry_name.hero`); a program
# named `main` is made as before.

# A word.
function word() -> str
    return "m"
